=== Team-Player table ===
The Team-Player table is what links a Player ID to a Team ID. It is basically a Team ID, followed by a list of 40 Player IDs that correspond to the players in that team, then the respective shirt numbers for those players.<br>
Start: HEX block 6773C4 <br>
End: HEX block 69DF4B <br>
